{"id": "FH20260609_Q01_GOOD_SYNTHETIC", "question_id": "FH20260609_Q01", "answer": "用户问题先进行必要的意图识别或改写，随后分别执行关键词检索和向量检索，融合并去重候选，再根据需要重排。将带来源的证据片段组装到有限上下文里生成答案；最后检查引用是否支持结论。检索不到可靠证据时应说明不确定，而不是让模型补事实。", "answer_provenance": "ASSISTANT_SYNTHETIC_NOT_REAL_INTERVIEW", "quality_label_for_offline_gold_only": "GOOD_SYNTHETIC", "quality_label_must_be_blinded": true, "technical_checkpoints": ["检索先于基于证据的回答", "证据与引用校验", "无命中时不编造"], "scoring_status": "CANDIDATE_REFERENCE_NOT_HUMAN_GOLD", "real_candidate": false}
{"id": "FH20260609_Q01_POOR_SYNTHETIC", "question_id": "FH20260609_Q01", "answer": "整个知识库就是先让大模型编出答案，再去数据库找几条看起来相似的内容证明它正确。检索没有命中时直接让模型依据常识回答即可，引用可以自动生成。", "answer_provenance": "ASSISTANT_SYNTHETIC_NOT_REAL_INTERVIEW", "quality_label_for_offline_gold_only": "POOR_SYNTHETIC", "quality_label_must_be_blinded": true, "technical_checkpoints": ["检索先于基于证据的回答", "证据与引用校验", "无命中时不编造"], "scoring_status": "CANDIDATE_REFERENCE_NOT_HUMAN_GOLD", "real_candidate": false}
{"id": "FH20260609_Q03_GOOD_SYNTHETIC", "question_id": "FH20260609_Q03", "answer": "优先按标题与段落结构切块，保留表格整体及标题路径；小块用于命中、大块或父段用于恢复上下文。可设置适度重叠，避免实体定义与结论被拆散，再用检索指标和具体失败样本调块大小，不能预设一种尺寸适合所有材料。", "answer_provenance": "ASSISTANT_SYNTHETIC_NOT_REAL_INTERVIEW", "quality_label_for_offline_gold_only": "GOOD_SYNTHETIC", "quality_label_must_be_blinded": true, "technical_checkpoints": ["结构分块", "表格保护", "重叠和粒度权衡"], "scoring_status": "CANDIDATE_REFERENCE_NOT_HUMAN_GOLD", "real_candidate": false}
{"id": "FH20260609_Q03_POOR_SYNTHETIC", "question_id": "FH20260609_Q03", "answer": "所有文件统一按每 100 个字符切一块，绝对不能重叠，否则搜索会失败；表格也按字符直接拆开，标题没有用，切得越短检索一定越准。", "answer_provenance": "ASSISTANT_SYNTHETIC_NOT_REAL_INTERVIEW", "quality_label_for_offline_gold_only": "POOR_SYNTHETIC", "quality_label_must_be_blinded": true, "technical_checkpoints": ["结构分块", "表格保护", "重叠和粒度权衡"], "scoring_status": "CANDIDATE_REFERENCE_NOT_HUMAN_GOLD", "real_candidate": false}
{"id": "FH20260609_Q07_GOOD_SYNTHETIC", "question_id": "FH20260609_Q07", "answer": "可以做拼写纠错、指代消解、子查询分解或多查询扩展，但要保留原始意图和实体约束。生成多路查询后比较召回覆盖与误召回，必要时同时使用原始 Query 兜底；含时间、姓名或否定约束时不能随意改写。", "answer_provenance": "ASSISTANT_SYNTHETIC_NOT_REAL_INTERVIEW", "quality_label_for_offline_gold_only": "GOOD_SYNTHETIC", "quality_label_must_be_blinded": true, "technical_checkpoints": ["保留限制条件", "对照原始查询", "评测误召回"], "scoring_status": "CANDIDATE_REFERENCE_NOT_HUMAN_GOLD", "real_candidate": false}
{"id": "FH20260609_Q07_POOR_SYNTHETIC", "question_id": "FH20260609_Q07", "answer": "先把用户的所有否定词和时间词都删掉，再让模型把问题改成更热门的问法，改写得越长越好。这样一定能提升所有查询的召回准确率，不需要保留原问题。", "answer_provenance": "ASSISTANT_SYNTHETIC_NOT_REAL_INTERVIEW", "quality_label_for_offline_gold_only": "POOR_SYNTHETIC", "quality_label_must_be_blinded": true, "technical_checkpoints": ["保留限制条件", "对照原始查询", "评测误召回"], "scoring_status": "CANDIDATE_REFERENCE_NOT_HUMAN_GOLD", "real_candidate": false}
{"id": "FH20260609_Q08_GOOD_SYNTHETIC", "question_id": "FH20260609_Q08", "answer": "先区分是真无文档、过滤过严、召回索引问题还是检索服务故障；可适度扩展查询或回退关键词检索，并记录可观察的原因。若仍缺可信来源，应明确告知用户无法依据知识库作答，并允许补充材料，不能伪造引文。", "answer_provenance": "ASSISTANT_SYNTHETIC_NOT_REAL_INTERVIEW", "quality_label_for_offline_gold_only": "GOOD_SYNTHETIC", "quality_label_must_be_blinded": true, "technical_checkpoints": ["空结果处理", "可靠性分级", "不伪造来源"], "scoring_status": "CANDIDATE_REFERENCE_NOT_HUMAN_GOLD", "real_candidate": false}
{"id": "FH20260609_Q08_POOR_SYNTHETIC", "question_id": "FH20260609_Q08", "answer": "没检索到资料就把相似度阈值设成负无穷，然后不管命中什么都提供答案。用户只需要答案，不用知道检索失败了，所以也应该自动编一个文档引用。", "answer_provenance": "ASSISTANT_SYNTHETIC_NOT_REAL_INTERVIEW", "quality_label_for_offline_gold_only": "POOR_SYNTHETIC", "quality_label_must_be_blinded": true, "technical_checkpoints": ["空结果处理", "可靠性分级", "不伪造来源"], "scoring_status": "CANDIDATE_REFERENCE_NOT_HUMAN_GOLD", "real_candidate": false}
{"id": "FH20260609_Q09_GOOD_SYNTHETIC", "question_id": "FH20260609_Q09", "answer": "多路召回可以并行使用 BM25 关键词检索和稠密向量检索，前者有利于精确术语与编号，后者弥补同义表达。融合可用 RRF 等排名法，而非直接相加未校准的原始分数，再用重排模型和标注查询评估召回与延迟。", "answer_provenance": "ASSISTANT_SYNTHETIC_NOT_REAL_INTERVIEW", "quality_label_for_offline_gold_only": "GOOD_SYNTHETIC", "quality_label_must_be_blinded": true, "technical_checkpoints": ["检索互补性", "RRF排名倒数", "分数尺度差异"], "scoring_status": "CANDIDATE_REFERENCE_NOT_HUMAN_GOLD", "real_candidate": false}
{"id": "FH20260609_Q09_POOR_SYNTHETIC", "question_id": "FH20260609_Q09", "answer": "BM25 和向量相似度总是同一量纲且数值都在零到一，直接相加就有理论保证。RRF 则是把两个检索得分相乘再取对数，因此肯定比任何重排方法都好。", "answer_provenance": "ASSISTANT_SYNTHETIC_NOT_REAL_INTERVIEW", "quality_label_for_offline_gold_only": "POOR_SYNTHETIC", "quality_label_must_be_blinded": true, "technical_checkpoints": ["检索互补性", "RRF排名倒数", "分数尺度差异"], "scoring_status": "CANDIDATE_REFERENCE_NOT_HUMAN_GOLD", "real_candidate": false}
{"id": "FH20260609_Q12_GOOD_SYNTHETIC", "question_id": "FH20260609_Q12", "answer": "可设输入规范化、检索、证据校验、回答生成和结果检查等节点；在 Typed State 中保存用户问题、检索证据、当前决策与有限错误信息，用条件边决定降级或重试。需要跨请求中断恢复时再选择合适的 Checkpointer，避免把持久化能力误说成所有图必须启用。", "answer_provenance": "ASSISTANT_SYNTHETIC_NOT_REAL_INTERVIEW", "quality_label_for_offline_gold_only": "GOOD_SYNTHETIC", "quality_label_must_be_blinded": true, "technical_checkpoints": ["状态图节点分解", "有界失败路径", "checkpoint按场景启用"], "scoring_status": "CANDIDATE_REFERENCE_NOT_HUMAN_GOLD", "real_candidate": false}
{"id": "FH20260609_Q12_POOR_SYNTHETIC", "question_id": "FH20260609_Q12", "answer": "把所有步骤写进一个节点，状态只存最后答案，异常就无限递归调用本节点。LangGraph 的任何节点都必须配置数据库 Checkpointer，否则框架根本无法运行。", "answer_provenance": "ASSISTANT_SYNTHETIC_NOT_REAL_INTERVIEW", "quality_label_for_offline_gold_only": "POOR_SYNTHETIC", "quality_label_must_be_blinded": true, "technical_checkpoints": ["状态图节点分解", "有界失败路径", "checkpoint按场景启用"], "scoring_status": "CANDIDATE_REFERENCE_NOT_HUMAN_GOLD", "real_candidate": false}
{"id": "FH20260609_Q14_GOOD_SYNTHETIC", "question_id": "FH20260609_Q14", "answer": "使用 SET key token NX PX ttl 原子获取锁；释放时通过 Lua 脚本比较 token 后删除，防止误删他人锁。TTL 要覆盖任务预期耗时或设计受控续租；还要说明锁过期后旧持有者继续执行的风险，涉及关键写入可结合 fencing token 或业务唯一约束。", "answer_provenance": "ASSISTANT_SYNTHETIC_NOT_REAL_INTERVIEW", "quality_label_for_offline_gold_only": "GOOD_SYNTHETIC", "quality_label_must_be_blinded": true, "technical_checkpoints": ["SET NX PX原子性", "compare-and-delete", "锁超时与fencing"], "scoring_status": "CANDIDATE_REFERENCE_NOT_HUMAN_GOLD", "real_candidate": false}
{"id": "FH20260609_Q14_POOR_SYNTHETIC", "question_id": "FH20260609_Q14", "answer": "先 GET 判断没有锁，再 SET 写入即可，因为 Redis 是单线程所以这两个命令天然是原子的。释放锁直接 DEL，不用确认是谁持有；锁过期也绝对不会引发并发写入。", "answer_provenance": "ASSISTANT_SYNTHETIC_NOT_REAL_INTERVIEW", "quality_label_for_offline_gold_only": "POOR_SYNTHETIC", "quality_label_must_be_blinded": true, "technical_checkpoints": ["SET NX PX原子性", "compare-and-delete", "锁超时与fencing"], "scoring_status": "CANDIDATE_REFERENCE_NOT_HUMAN_GOLD", "real_candidate": false}
{"id": "FH20260609_Q15_GOOD_SYNTHETIC", "question_id": "FH20260609_Q15", "answer": "穿透是查询不存在的数据反复落到后端，可结合空值缓存、布隆过滤器及限流；击穿是热点 Key 失效引发并发回源，可用互斥重建或逻辑过期；雪崩是大量 Key 同时过期或 Redis 故障，可用 TTL 抖动、多级缓存、降级和容量保护。", "answer_provenance": "ASSISTANT_SYNTHETIC_NOT_REAL_INTERVIEW", "quality_label_for_offline_gold_only": "GOOD_SYNTHETIC", "quality_label_must_be_blinded": true, "technical_checkpoints": ["穿透击穿雪崩区分", "热点重建", "TTL抖动与限流"], "scoring_status": "CANDIDATE_REFERENCE_NOT_HUMAN_GOLD", "real_candidate": false}
{"id": "FH20260609_Q15_POOR_SYNTHETIC", "question_id": "FH20260609_Q15", "answer": "缓存穿透是一个热门 key 过期，雪崩是查询不存在的 key，击穿是所有 key 同时过期。最好的方案是给所有 key 设置完全相同的 60 秒过期时间，保证缓存刷新整齐。", "answer_provenance": "ASSISTANT_SYNTHETIC_NOT_REAL_INTERVIEW", "quality_label_for_offline_gold_only": "POOR_SYNTHETIC", "quality_label_must_be_blinded": true, "technical_checkpoints": ["穿透击穿雪崩区分", "热点重建", "TTL抖动与限流"], "scoring_status": "CANDIDATE_REFERENCE_NOT_HUMAN_GOLD", "real_candidate": false}
{"id": "FH20260609_Q16_GOOD_SYNTHETIC", "question_id": "FH20260609_Q16", "answer": "Redis 低延迟来自内存访问、高效数据结构、事件驱动的 I/O 多路复用以及避免许多锁争用。不能简单说 Redis 的所有操作都 O(1)：例如全量扫描、复杂集合操作或大 key 会阻塞请求，网络往返与持久化策略也影响实际延迟。", "answer_provenance": "ASSISTANT_SYNTHETIC_NOT_REAL_INTERVIEW", "quality_label_for_offline_gold_only": "GOOD_SYNTHETIC", "quality_label_must_be_blinded": true, "technical_checkpoints": ["内存及事件循环", "复杂命令与大key", "不可把所有操作说成O1"], "scoring_status": "CANDIDATE_REFERENCE_NOT_HUMAN_GOLD", "real_candidate": false}
{"id": "FH20260609_Q16_POOR_SYNTHETIC", "question_id": "FH20260609_Q16", "answer": "Redis 快只因为它所有命令都是 O(1)，并且每个客户端请求都创建一个新线程并行执行。大 key 完全不会影响其他请求，因为 Redis 在任何版本里都不会发生阻塞。", "answer_provenance": "ASSISTANT_SYNTHETIC_NOT_REAL_INTERVIEW", "quality_label_for_offline_gold_only": "POOR_SYNTHETIC", "quality_label_must_be_blinded": true, "technical_checkpoints": ["内存及事件循环", "复杂命令与大key", "不可把所有操作说成O1"], "scoring_status": "CANDIDATE_REFERENCE_NOT_HUMAN_GOLD", "real_candidate": false}
